{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_title", "source_sha256": "39e4d625d7284b1bcfda0023f93e3e0e7e59109ea4a9c127d32ba9075210637b", "ja": "うみみん☆キャンプへようこそ！", "zh": "欢迎来到海美美☆露营！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b2a516033cff824edc2769fd7a11d654101a27e33dc89c500a953ebd881bbcb9", "ja": "もうすぐ学校で体育祭がある事を、憂鬱そう\nに語るロコ。スポーツの楽しさを教えたい！\nと、新曲からヒントを得た海美は、劇場での\nお泊り特訓会を企画する。運動を楽しんだメ\nンバー達は、パワフルな公演を完成させた。", "zh": "ROCO忧郁地提起学校马上就要举办体育祭了。\n想要告诉她运动的乐趣！\n海美从新曲中获得启发，策划了在剧场\n留宿的特训会。享受了运动乐趣的\n成员们，最终完成了一场充满力量的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20a789d9aa9bd655b7ec44199debfea2baf9f392f1529bc0c98521b09830f65e", "ja": "（曲が終わると、大きな拍手と歓声があがった。\n客席の人達も汗だくだけど、みんな笑顔だ！）", "zh": "（曲子结束后，响起了热烈的掌声和欢呼声。观众们也都汗流浃背，但每个人脸上都带着笑容！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "55183250e8f5927203146f8b7f31a61621317bd643f643e1ec17910256a69456", "ja": "お疲れ様、{$P$}！\nみんなと一緒に、がっつり体動かしてきたよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n和大家一起痛痛快快地活动了一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9ffe35c18693547374d838d6b8fd78f998a66568d3ffce6c591532234dad4c52", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ様。\n見てるこっちも元気になれる良いステージだったよ。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。\n这是场很棒的舞台，光是在旁边看着都让人精神起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "45370fe29d220a800539ecac9c30f34840b662fdf143b77117d08026b1dd3ba3", "ja": "うんうん！　一緒に踊ってて私も楽しかったもん。\n楽しすぎて、練習よりも多く動いちゃったかも♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！一起跳舞，我也很开心呢。\n太开心了，说不定比练习时还多动了几下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "cffd2bcc31b798b19e4d7050d35496a36f6e2f93b452bebc04f6d3756a89bfab", "ja": "ステージが終わるとヘトヘトなロコですけど、今日は\n平気です！　きっとウミのレッスンのおかげですね♪", "zh": "舞台结束后总是累得筋疲力尽的ROCO，不过今天没事！一定是多亏了海美的训练吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "60360b38c0c23b558fb17354859e4aefd9d2f0f722a171643c6e4a74369246c6", "ja": "わあ、やったねロコちゃん！　私も今日のステージ、\n体が軽かったかな～。成長したの可奈～♪", "zh": "哇，太好了呢ROCO！我也觉得今天的舞台演出，\n身体很轻快呢～。难道是成长了吗～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cf5cb8a16c5eea5a5d03a945d3a95eb5b94617cc9358d86f6bb35fa90b7073b4", "ja": "おお。可奈とロコにお泊り会の成果が……。\nよかったな、海美！", "zh": "哦，可奈和ROCO身上显现出了留宿会的成果……太好了，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "44392df61d47d30f178889590c70ee2918976ced1137a5bf3877a2f000938045", "ja": "うん！　ふたりが頑張って特訓した証拠だね！\nかなりんもロコロコも、すっごく楽しそうだったよ！", "zh": "嗯！这是她们两个努力特训的成果证明呢！\n可奈和ROCOROCO看起来都特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "28644210b6adb9fb01ccec8f07c02ebf4956f16f55c9d64c867de47cfdc4f3e8", "ja": "ねえねえ、うみみ！　たまきはー？\nたまきもいっぱい頑張ったから、ほめてほめてー！", "zh": "呐呐，海美！环呢？  \n环也努力了好多，所以夸夸我，夸夸我嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "82841d3bd23de1261c030bd3af1240c87a7a61886ed8d9bbdeb6fc82911bc26e", "ja": "亜美もほめてほめて～！　だってうみみんのステージ、\nめっちゃ体力いるんだもん！　ホント疲れたよ～！", "zh": "亚美也要夸夸我～！因为海美的舞台真的超级耗体力嘛！我真的累坏了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "dd77c6022ff79f8875e0fd4e1467d5f12cf733d634bacba958f60d115b61b6dc", "ja": "あはは、それじゃ褒めちゃう！\n環や亜美のおかげで、私もたくさん頑張れたよ！", "zh": "啊哈哈，那我就好好夸夸你！\n多亏了环和亚美，我也超努力的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "002a915fdaebac5dcee4652c022f3be16cb8f884cbdc3ff60888d937d5c11e2e", "ja": "だってふたりとも、私より元気そうなんだもん！\nだから、負けてられないって、えへへっ！", "zh": "因为你们两个看起来都比我更有活力嘛！\n所以我也不能输，嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "635fc6c9dabcb93cdd134cdaf2f594d06f9bc345a48a4521b208e59ece3af186", "ja": "くふふっ♪　うみみにほめられたぞ～！\nうみみの曲、なんか面白いよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　被海美夸奖了哦～！\n海美的歌，感觉很有意思呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "234947674cc189cf197807e9e32df976aa86943e987b491de09c71a0cde62260", "ja": "でも難しい言葉がいっぱいだぞ……。\nねえ、おやぶん？　『ぜんわんきん』って何？", "zh": "不过里面有好多难懂的词……  \n对了，老大？“前臂肌”是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1014_p", "source_sha256": "43a770a5caf44175db42194ee9d527cea5d466067ff1a8aac65a9dc3c2a7b5a3", "ja": "えっ、前腕筋！？　……ああ、歌詞に出てくるやつか。\nたしか手首から肘にかけての筋肉だったかな……？", "zh": "诶，前臂肌！？……啊，是歌词里出现的那个吧。\n我记得好像是从手腕到手肘的肌肉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "664dddede5c29ab1336a870da6e42539222ebc2ccdf803d3534582ae49e85eb6", "ja": "とにかく、運動するぞーって曲だから、\n亜美、なんにも考えないで踊ってたかも。", "zh": "总之，这是首让人运动起来的歌，所以亚美可能什么都没想就跳起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "f97858848927588979358852def76487233cae94d79c32c82b637fe91a9dd382", "ja": "私もだよ！　曲に合わせて、あとは勢いでって感じ！\nその方が、楽しさがより伝わるかなって思って。", "zh": "我也是！配合歌曲，然后就靠气势一路跳的感觉！我觉得那样更能传达快乐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9309fbfc084b289d4aae3e170507690e4c5a68380bd4e4b25427aa9e4e101a6e", "ja": "ああ、それでいいと思うよ。\n楽しい気持ちを伝えることが大事だからな。", "zh": "啊，我觉得那样就很好。\n因为传达快乐的心情才是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "f4b5dd8d6e30ea228e9ba75a0ac8bd87135849666100773d9706923e939da6e0", "ja": "なるほど。アートもステージもフィーリングが\n大事ってことですね！　やっぱり深いです……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，无论是艺术还是舞台，感觉都很重要呢！果然很深奥……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "40e5016836dd00ba9d0b52a6bb13583019f459566823336989b1d10e64e9e423", "ja": "でも、ステージが終わったばっかりだけど、\nまだまだ足りないかも！　ううっ～！", "zh": "不过，虽然演出才刚结束，感觉还是远远不够！呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1020_audience", "source_sha256": "fd62ed9d0898007b94b31f8bb921ed1cfa3949e130f1da878dadb783003e73bc", "ja": "（アンコール！　アンコール！）", "zh": "（安可！安可！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "f04e593d0bbba796fa4c656b0d6617752cd4e369ca28ee825964ddbc633e71f2", "ja": "やったー！　じゃあ、行ってきまーす！！", "zh": "太好啦——！那我出发啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "4ece8d5fe1f5ee00b21e6f5e5fe03886760ede72abfa2af65079315d8b78303c", "ja": "あ、ずるいぞ！　待って、うみみ！\nたまきも！", "zh": "啊，太狡猾了！等等，海美！\n环也要去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "36b0b159350c0e4eb5be81eb21cc1bf134573458e8b1f699cd3c37022a27a8fa", "ja": "さすがうみみん、秒速のアンコールステージだね！\n面白そうだから、亜美もいこーっと！", "zh": "真不愧是海美，秒速就开安可舞台啦！看起来挺有意思的，亚美也去咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f6cfe053bc601710b672528170732902c5766837197b19f616073a9eff98cee", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いいんですよね？\nじゃあ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，可以的吧？\n那我走啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "cd4d5c488d165ba52aa4b4d287bff990f5bc4869f8e5a95a8d5b0aa8bc2d1477", "ja": "うう、正直ロコはもうちょっと休憩を……\nああっ、待ってください～！", "zh": "呜呜，老实说ROCO还想再休息一下……\n啊啊，等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1026_null", "source_sha256": "002489b0c021b70f8e5fa82bf1cc796e6b062d490968a13cc9348ed5ad44ffd2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7fd38fc10421a8b69d499e2bba71241435c1c1fee35b91e2beb8c446e0e307bd", "ja": "（海美のステージは、見ている人の心に働きかける\n不思議な魅力に溢れている……）", "zh": "（海美的舞台充满了不可思议的魅力，能够打动观看者的心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_089_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_089_1028_p", "source_sha256": "0df12e7089c5499464b842de45db72da10f7ee57dafb448e2c8cf1cf73d3da5c", "ja": "（この曲を通して、\nいつか運動の楽しさも伝えられるかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（说不定有一天，也能通过这首歌传达运动的乐趣呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
